"lap":0,"text":"Halford and Kaye Don fail to start and are pushed to their pits.","q":false,"c":9},{"lap":1,"text":"The maroon went off thunderously, but somewhat late, and already Divo's Talbot was way ahead of the pack, with the 37 others hard in pursuit.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":1,"text":"Hawkes' Eldridge Special hits the tail of Eyston's Bugatti at the hairpin; Hawkes is out.","q":false,"c":37},{"lap":1,"text":"At the end of the first lap Divo headed Moriceau by a clear 100 yards, followed by Harvey, Campbell, Segrave and the Earl of Cottenham.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":2,"text":"Eyston drives to his pit, where the Bugatti is retired with a badly bent rear axle.","q":false,"c":29},{"lap":3,"text":"On the third lap Segrave moved up into second place and the Talbots settled down to a lap speed of 75 mph.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":3,"text":"Norris's supercharged Lea-Francis is out with supercharger trouble.","q":false,"c":28},{"lap":5,"text":"Marendaz retires after four laps, out of oil from the sump.","q":false,"c":27},{"lap":13,"text":"Campbell pits with a loose oil union and drops from sixth to 13th.","q":false,"c":18},{"lap":16,"text":"Basil Eyston's Aston Martin strips its magneto drive and retires; he pushes it into the pits single-handedly.","q":false,"c":26},{"lap":18,"text":"At quarter-distance Casse's Salmson still led the 1100 class with Morel's 6-cylinder works Amilcar following six seconds behind and Goutte in the other works Salmson third.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":21},{"lap":18,"text":"Dutoit, up to third in the 1100 class, is out with a broken cardan shaft; de Marmier retires with a slipping clutch.","q":false,"c":36},{"lap":22,"text":"Duray in the Amilcar made a call at the pits on the 22nd lap.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":4},{"lap":23,"text":"Harvey is baulked at 80 mph and skids off backwards into a telegraph pole; the Alvis is too badly damaged to go on.","q":false,"c":24},{"lap":24,"text":"Densham's Bugatti has a throttle stick open, catches fire and drops out.","q":false,"c":34},{"lap":27,"text":"Sutton in the standard 12/50 Alvis retired on lap 27 with stripped timing gears when running in sixth place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":23},{"lap":30,"text":"After 30 laps, the three Talbots were in the lead with Divo still in front, followed by Segrave and then Moriceau in third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":1},{"lap":31,"text":"Cottenham's Alvis splutters and stops; believing an oil pipe has broken, he retires.","q":false,"c":22},{"lap":34,"text":"Divo pits for oil, water and fuel; the stop takes 1m55s and hands Segrave the lead.","q":false,"c":1},{"lap":37,"text":"On lap 37, Segrave stopped to fill up, using the same routine but took less time than Divo","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":42,"text":"Moriceau is baulked at the second S-bend and slides into the sandbank, where his Talbot sticks fast; he starts digging it out with a small stick.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":48,"text":"Morel pits with clutch trouble; Casse then retires with engine trouble and Duray takes the 1100 lead.","q":false,"c":21},{"lap":52,"text":"Campbell retires with serious engine trouble.","q":false,"c":18},{"lap":55,"text":"At three-quarters distance the Talbots of Segrave and Divo were in the lead with Purdy's Bugatti third.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":60,"text":"On lap 60 Purdy's 4-cylinder Bugatti was still in third place.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":2},{"lap":60,"text":"Moriceau has fallen many laps behind but is now lapping fastest of all.","q":false,"c":13},{"lap":64,"text":"Morel stops 1m15s fighting clutch slip and falls to third in class; Martin leads the 1100s.","q":false,"c":6},{"lap":70,"text":"On lap 70 Segrave was about half a lap in front of his teammate Divo.","q":true,"src":"goldenera.fi","c":0},{"lap":73,"text":"Segrave wins in 2h40m22.2s at 75.56 mph, a lap ahead of Divo and ten laps clear of Purdy's Bugatti.","q":false,"c":0},{"lap":73,"text":"Martin's Amilcar is fourth and wins the 1100 class.","q":false,"c":3}]}